body:
### Checked for duplicates?

- [x] This issue is not a duplicate

### Does it also happen in the desktop version?

- [x] This bug does not occur in the latest version of Anki Desktop

### What are the steps to reproduce this bug?

To use Nastaliq script I've added the following to the css of my card type:

@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Nastaliq+Urdu&display=swap');

.card {
    font-family: "Noto Nastaliq Urdu";
    font-size: 20px;
    text-align: center;
    color: black;
    background-color: white;
}

After this, review any card with arabic script.

### Expected behaviour

When displaying the arabic text, the given font is not used, and the review screen freezes. I can still use the answer buttons, but the card preview will be stuck on the first card that c
